ều&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(199, 37, 78);&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 16.1px;&quot;&gt;LoTrinh&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 16.1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(điểm dừng). Nếu Chuyến xe bị hủy, toàn bộ Lộ trình của nó cũng bị hủy hoàn toàn theo, không tồn tại độc lập.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width=&quot;285&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 5pt 7pt; border-top-color: inherit; border-right-color: inherit; border-width: 0px 0px 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-bottom-color: lightgrey; border-left-color: inherit; background-color: white; width: 213.6pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 2pt 0cm; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 16.1px;&quot;&gt;Lớp&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(199, 37, 78);&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 16.1px;&quot;&gt;DonHang&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 16.1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;có phương thức&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: